{
  "title": "Quick Energizing Indian Tamarind Rasam",
  "description": "A spicy and energizing Indian dish featuring cardamom, this tamarind rasam is a buddhist-temple-friendly recipe that is easy to make and delicious to eat. It has a unique glassy-jelly texture.",
  "cuisine": "Indian",
  "diet": [
